{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:32bdf02c837d4e55","name":"Tendrando Arms","source":{"id":"source:reference-32bdf02c837d4e55","title":"Tendrando Arms","revision":24513,"timestamp":"2024-11-03T15:55:11Z","sha256":"50bf2dc019d0086161d1889ad3785b84ab28a5bf44bbc30775fe6a3ab8165255","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=24513","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Tendrando%20Arms&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-32bdf02c837d4e55","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Scavenger's Guide to Droids"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Scavenger%27s_Guide_to_Droids"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["The Yuuzhan Vong Invasion decimates the galactic ",{"tag":"a","children":["Droid"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Droid"}," market. Because of their fanatical hatred of mechanical automatons, the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Yuuzhan Vong"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Yuuzhan_Vong","referenceId":"reference:93079e2f7d73d480"}," raze ",{"tag":"a","children":["Droid"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Droid"}," plants by the thousands, destroying or disabling companies and causing the shutdown of plants far from the invasion corridor. ",{"tag":"a","children":["Lando Calrissian"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Lando_Calrissian","referenceId":"reference:ad9ea8d29f7eda36"}," and his wife, ",{"tag":"a","children":["Tendra Risant"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Tendra_Risant?action=edit&redlink=1"},", restart several idle factories with their new company, Tendrando Arms, producing ",{"tag":"a","children":["Droids"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Droids","referenceId":"reference:6e72e583603b9ea8"}," specifically designed to battle the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Yuuzhan Vong"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Yuuzhan_Vong","referenceId":"reference:93079e2f7d73d480"},". With the defeat of ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Yuuzhan Vong Empire"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Yuuzhan_Vong_Empire","referenceId":"reference:418e7b3078742a07"},", Tendrando Arms provides security, guardian, and related Droids to ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Galactic Alliance"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Galactic_Alliance","referenceId":"reference:bd53073ee6d4d9a0"}," and ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Jedi Order"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Jedi_Order"},".\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Manufacturer Traits:"]}," Tendrando Arms Droids are efficient Security and Combat Droids. Their ",{"tag":"a","children":["YVH-Series Battle Droid"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/YVH-Series_Battle_Droid","referenceId":"reference:e1e5b64d8f798c7c"}," design angers the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Yuuzhan Vong"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Yuuzhan_Vong","referenceId":"reference:93079e2f7d73d480"}," at a primitive level. Tendrando Arms Droids use this antagonism to their advantage. A Tendrando Arms Droid gains a +2 circumstance bonus to its ",{"tag":"a","children":["Reflex Defense"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Reflex_Defense"}," and ",{"tag":"a","children":["Will Defense"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Will_Defense"}," against ",{"tag":"a","children":["Yuuzhan Vong"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Yuuzhan_Vong","referenceId":"reference:93079e2f7d73d480"},".\n"]},"\n","\n","\n","\n\n","\n\n","\n"]}}
